            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Создайте личную автоматизацию «Время суток» в приложении «Команды»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exact duplicates already in the library reuse the original entry, keeping favorites and collections.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exact duplicates already in the library reuse the original entry, keeping favorites and collections."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Точные повторы связываются с существующей записью. Избранное и коллекции сохраняются."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import Markdown, TXT, CSV, TSV, JSON or JSONL. Each file becomes a topic. Up to 100 MB and 100,000 entries per file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import Markdown, TXT, CSV, TSV, JSON or JSONL. Each file becomes a topic. Up to 100 MB and 100,000 entries per file."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Импортируйте Markdown, TXT, CSV, TSV, JSON или JSONL. Каждый файл станет темой. Лимит файла — 100 МБ и 100 000 записей."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import cancelled. Completed files remain in your library.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import cancelled. Completed files remain in your library."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Импорт отменён. Уже обработанные файлы остались в библиотеке."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep text readable over your photo using the overlay and text color.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep text readable over your photo using the overlay and text color."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Настройте затемнение и цвет текста, чтобы запись легко читалась поверх фото."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LERN creates the image locally. Only your Shortcuts automation changes the wallpaper. iOS may require confirmation for your chosen automation settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LERN creates the image locally. Only your Shortcuts automation changes the wallpaper. iOS may require confirmation for your chosen automation settings."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LERN создаёт изображение на устройстве. Обои меняет ваша автоматизация в «Командах». В зависимости от настроек iOS может потребовать подтверждение."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let your own words meet you during the day.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let your own words meet you during the day."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Возвращайтесь к своим мыслям в течение дня."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Matching entries will be hidden from the feed, reminders, widgets and Watch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Matching entries will be hidden from the feed, reminders, widgets and Watch."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Совпадающие записи будут скрыты в ленте, напоминаниях, виджетах и на часах."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Medium and large widgets support favorite and open/share actions. Refresh timing is managed by iOS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Medium and large widgets support favorite and open/share actions. Refresh timing is managed by iOS."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Средние и большие виджеты позволяют добавить в избранное и открыть запись для отправки. Частоту обновления контролирует iOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Merge adds missing content and collections while keeping your current settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Merge adds missing content and collections while keeping your current settings."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Объединение добавляет недостающие записи и коллекции, сохраняя текущие настройки."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications are turned off in iOS Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notifications are turned off in iOS Settings."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Уведомления выключены в настройках iOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications follow Apple's normal iPhone and Watch mirroring rules.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notifications follow Apple's normal iPhone and Watch mirroring rules."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Уведомления показываются на iPhone и часах по стандартным правилам Apple."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pass its image to Set Wallpaper Photo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pass its image to Set Wallpaper Photo."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Передайте изображение действию «Установить фото обоев»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sample thoughts, icons and sounds are original. This app is not affiliated with Monkey Taps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sample thoughts, icons and sounds are original. This app is not affiliated with Monkey Taps."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Примеры мыслей, значки и звуки созданы для LERN. Приложение не связано с Monkey Taps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save a complete local copy of your library, themes, photos, favorites, collections and settings. Choose where it goes in Files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save a complete local copy of your library, themes, photos, favorites, collections and settings. Choose where it goes in Files."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Сохраните полную копию библиотеки, оформлений, фото, избранного, коллекций и настроек. Место сохранения выберите в «Файлах»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scheduled means iOS accepted a request, not proof that it was shown. Opened is recorded only after a notification or deep link is opened.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scheduled means iOS accepted a request, not proof that it was shown. Opened is recorded only after a notification or deep link is opened."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "«Запланировано» означает, что iOS приняла запрос, но не подтверждает показ. «Открыто» записывается после открытия уведомления или ссылки."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Showing the first 200 matching entries. Search to narrow this collection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Showing the first 200 matching entries. Search to narrow this collection."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Показаны первые 200 подходящих записей. Уточните поиск, чтобы найти остальные."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some reminder groups overlap. Both will be scheduled. Edit the times if you prefer more space between them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Some reminder groups overlap. Both will be scheduled. Edit the times if you prefer more space between them."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Время некоторых групп совпадает. Обе будут запланированы. Измените время, если нужен интервал между напоминаниями."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Watch receives a local selection of up to 100 entries from this source. Open LERN on your iPhone after changing it. No internet is required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Watch receives a local selection of up to 100 entries from this source. Open LERN on your iPhone after changing it. No internet is required."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Часы получают до 100 записей из этого источника. После его изменения откройте LERN на iPhone. Интернет не нужен."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This alarm is a local notification. It follows Focus and silent-mode settings and does not behave like a critical system alarm.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This alarm is a local notification. It follows Focus and silent-mode settings and does not behave like a critical system alarm."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Это локальное уведомление. Оно учитывает фокусирование и беззвучный режим и не работает как критический системный будильник."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This entry is no longer in your library.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This entry is no longer in your library."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Этой записи больше нет в библиотеке."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This source applies only to the screen you are editing. Other sources stay independent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This source applies only to the screen you are editing. Other sources stay independent."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Этот источник применяется только к текущему экрану. Остальные настраиваются независимо."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own words, always close. A private, local reading library.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your own words, always close. A private, local reading library."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ваши мысли всегда рядом. Личная библиотека на вашем устройстве."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your reading history will appear here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your reading history will appear here."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Здесь появится история чтения."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS keeps a limited queue. Open LERN to replenish it. At 10 reminders a day, 60 reminders cover about 6 days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS keeps a limited queue. Open LERN to replenish it. At 10 reminders a day, 60 reminders cover about 6 days."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Очередь iOS ограничена. Открывайте LERN для её пополнения. При 10 напоминаниях в день очередь из 60 запросов рассчитана примерно на 6 дней."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A little room\nto think.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A little room\nto think."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Немного места\nдля мысли."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give your thoughts\na place to breathe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Give your thoughts\na place to breathe."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Дайте мыслям\nсвободное пространство."
          }
        }
      }
    },
